    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d200-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d200-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Johnson Library, National Security File, Country File, Dominican
                    Republic, Vol. XVII. Secret. The meeting was held in the White House Situation
                    Room. A copy was sent to Walt Rostow.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d200-f2" n="2" xml:id="d200-f2-content">
                <p>A May 8 memorandum for the record of the 303 Committee May 5 meeting, immediately
                    following the review group meeting reported that “Although Mr. Vance reiterated
                    certain reservations about the proposal, he cast his vote with the majority
                    view. Since three of the four 303 principals were present and CIA was
                    represented by Mr. FitzGerald, the proposal was considered approved.” (National
                    Security Council, Special Group/303 Committee Files, Subject Files, Dominican
                    Republic 1967)</p>
            </note>
